<title>PHILIPPINES: Ebecom to buy 52,000-square metre lot.</title>
<headline>Ebecom to buy 52,000-square metre lot.</headline>
<dateline>MANILA 1997-07-22</dateline>
<text>
<p>Ebecom Holdings Inc said on Tuesday its board had authorised its management to buy a 52,000-square metre lot in Cavite, south of Manila.</p>
<p>Ebecom was recently bought by a group of investors led by Philippine Racing Club Inc which would like to transfer its race track out of Manila and re-develop its present site into a mixed-use commercial and residential complex.</p>
<p>No other details were made available on the planned purchase.</p>
<p>-- Manila Newsroom (63 2) 841-8938 Fax 817-6267</p>
</text>
